The term inside the sum in $\mathcal{L}_{\text{c}}$ represents the soft maximum of the CCBF values of the sampled states as well as the following state appearing in the training trajectory. The temperature parameter $\tau$ controls the smoothness of the soft maximum. As $\tau$ decreases, the soft maximum approaches the actual maximum.
