We solve the QP without actuation constraints, and then scale the control input as \( \mathbf{u}_{\mathrm{scaled}} = \frac{\mathbf{u}}{\|\mathbf{u}\|_2}\, v_{\max} \) to ensure it satisfies the actuation constraints. 

