deterministic and in the form of the control-affine dynamics in equation (\ref{eq:latent_dynamics}). Each episode results in a trajectory $\sigma := \{x_1, u_1, r_1, c_1, \dots, x_T, u_T, r_T, c_T\}$, where the subscript represents the index of the sampling time. 

