where $R_\sigma^\pi = \sum_t r_t$ denotes the policy's reward return when generating trajectory $\sigma$, $C_\sigma^\pi = \sum_t c_t$ denotes its cost return, and $R_{\text{min}}$ and $R_{\text{max}}$ 
