\includegraphics[width=0.95\linewidth]{GVDeffarea.pdf}
\caption{\label{fig:effarea}
Effective area of Baikal-GVD for the detection of very high energy neutrino-induced cascades as a function of the neutrino energy (exposure-weighted average over the upper hemisphere).
