For notational convenience, we define a sequence of potentials for Algorithms \ref{alg:unf-sfom-pm}, \ref{alg:unf-sfom}, and \ref{alg:unf-sfom-rm} as
\begin{align}\label{def:pot-pm}
{\mathcal P}_k := f(x^k) + p_k\|m^k - \nabla f(x^k)\|^\alpha \qquad \forall k \ge 0,
\end{align}
where the sequence $\{(x^k, m^k)\}$ is generated by each respective algorithm, and $\{p_k\}$ is a %nonincreasing 
sequence of positive scalars that will be specified separately for each case.
