\begin{abstract}
    This work studies $t$-structures for the derived category of quasi-coherent sheaves on a quasi-compact quasi-separated algebraic stack. Specifically, using Thomason filtrations, we classify those $t$-structures which are generated by perfect complexes and satisfy a tensor compatibility. Interestingly, the only input required is the classification \`{a} la Hrbek for the affine scheme case.
\end{abstract}

