\subsection{Speaker consistency evaluation}

\mmedit{In the same-speaker case, the proposed method consistently achieved SECS scores above 0.85 for all emotions (Angry, Sad, and Happy), indicating that our method achieved comparable or slightly better speaker consistency than that of the baseline method.}

