In this way, the complex $\TS_{\AA^n}^{I\sqcup\{\ast\}}$ becomes the totalization a bicomplex:
\be \left(\TS_{\AA^n}^{I\sqcup\{\ast\}},\dd_{\TS}\right)  \cong \Tot\left( \TS_{\AA^n}^{I} \ox_{\O_{(\AA^n)^I}} \mathbf{Q}^I_{\AA^n} , \dd'_{\mathbf{P}}, \dd_{\mathbf{Q}}\right).\nn\ee


