To update the codebook, we use the following update rule:
    \begin{equation*}
        \mathcal{L}_{\text{quantization}}=\|\text{sg}(E_\phi(X))-e_u\|_2^2+\beta\|\text{sg}(e_u)-e_u\|_2^2,
