\subsection{Statistical Analysis}
\label{subsec_stats}

Statistical analysis has been performed to determine whether the maximum temperature at the focal spot increased during treatment when comparing between the initial and repeat MRgFUS surgery. All sonications for five patients in \textit{Treat} mode were analysed, and two groups of maximum temperatures during sonications — corresponding to the unsuccessful first and the successful second surgery— were compared using the Wilcoxon rank-sum left-sided test. The maximum temperatures recorded throughout the procedure were also analysed for each patient during both the unsuccessful first and the successful second surgery. This paired data was further evaluated using the Wilcoxon signed-rank left-sided test.

\subsection{CT Imaging Protocol}
\label{subsec_ct}

