\title{The Cost of Restaking vs. Proof-of-Stake\thanks{We thank Ed Felten, Manvir Schneider, Paolo Penna, Pranay Anchuri, Christoph Schlegel and Bruno Mazorra for useful discussions. No AI was consulted when working on the paper. All errors are our own.}}
