    Let $\Gamma \coloneqq \ZZ/2\times \ZZ/2$ endowed with the $G$-action exchanging the coordinates. We let $\Gamma$ act on $\mathbb A^1_{\mathbb R}$ via $(a,b)*x \coloneqq (-1)^{a+b}x$. To compute $\vert \mathcal X(\mathbb R)\vert  \coloneqq [\mathbb A^1_{\mathbb R}/\Gamma]$, we start observing that $\rm  H^1(G,\Gamma)=0$. Hence 
