    h^\ast(\vert I_{[X/\Gamma]}(\mathbb C)\vert) &= \# K \cdot  h^\ast(M(\CC)) + \sum_{x \in \Delta}\left(\# (\Gamma_{y_x}/\Gamma_{y_x})  - \# K\right), 
