If $\Gamma_{y_x}$ is abelian for each $x \in \Delta$, then one has
$\Gamma_{y_x}/\Gamma_{y_x}=\Gamma_{y_x}$, $Q_{y_x}/Q_{y_x}=Q_{y_x}$ and $\#K \cdot \# Q_{y_x} = \# \Gamma_{y_x}.$
Therefore, \eqref{eq:FXGam:2} follows from \eqref{align:dim-coh-inertia} and \eqref{align:QKGamma:2}, and we are done. 
